# Separation of duties: branch protection requires a code owner's approval,
# so the agent that wrote a change can never approve it. Replace the
# placeholder teams with your own.

# Default owner for everything.
*                       @your-org/engineering

# The configuration that steers the agent is reviewed like code.
/CLAUDE.md              @your-org/tech-leads
/REVIEW.md              @your-org/tech-leads
/.claude/               @your-org/platform-team
/managed-settings/      @your-org/platform-team

# Policy owners sign off changes to their skills.
/.claude/skills/secure-api-review/  @your-org/security
/.claude/skills/brand-voice/        @your-org/brand

# The product owner accepts intents and specs.
/intent/                @your-org/product-owners

# The Stage 6 harness is production code.
/monitoring/            @your-org/platform-team
/evals/                 @your-org/platform-team
